 "description": "Use this when the user asks how the Pok\u00e9mon card market is moving, which cards or sets are up or down, or for today's market report. PokeFocus Market Pulse, the daily Pok\u00e9mon card market report: headline, 7-day direction, cards up and down, and each section's summary with the cards or sealed products it highlights (price, 7-day change, sales) and its ranked set and sealed tables. Also lists recent reports.",
